{
	quest.025A68F7B4788055.quest_desc: ["To get the &5Unobtainium Arcanist Hat&r, we'll need an &2Elemental Hat&r. Any &2Element&r, it doesn't matter! \\n\\nEach are made in a similar way. You'll upgrade an &dArs Hat&r with a &eMark of Mastery&r, 2 &2Elemental Essence&r, and a &cNetherite Ingot&r. \\n\\nIt can be made with a &dSorcerer's&f, &dMage's&f, or &dArchmage's Hat&r. \\n\\nThe &eMark of Mastery&r is a very hard Item to acquire. You'll need a &5Wilden Tribute&r, all &2Elemental Essences&r, plus &dAbjuration&f, &bConjuration&f, and &6Manipulation Essences&f, along with &9Anima Essence&r! \\n\\nIt also requires a ton of &dSource&r to make every single one of those Items and the &dHat&r itself."]
	quest.025A68F7B4788055.title: "&2Elemental Hats"
	quest.047973571C039ED2.quest_desc: ["Now to start our &6Ritual&r. Place the &bRitual Bell&r and &cIncense Brazier&r connected to &7Refined Salt&r that is connected to the &6Altar&r. \\n\\nThen, place the &bMana Salt&f, &eHallowed Shard&f, &9Creature Rune&f, and &9Summon Rune&r on the Pedestals. \\n\\nOnce you are ready, use your &6Wand&r on the &6Ritual Altar&r to start it. It will tell you that the &6Ritual&r has started and a ball of Energy will appear above it. \\n\\nThe &6Ritual&r will slowly start taking the Items and might ask of you to interact with the Props. Right Click the &bRitual Bell&r to make it ring, or put &cIncense &finto the &cIncense Brazier&r and Right Click it to light it. \\n\\nOnce all is done, you will get your &eHallowed Pixie&r!"]
	quest.047973571C039ED2.title: "&eHallowed Pixie"
	quest.06480C731E286A40.quest_desc: ["&5Lightning Dragons&r are the newest and hardest Dragons to find! \\n\\nTheir &5Roosts &fand &5Caves&r can be found in Jungles, Savannahs, or Badlands. They look very similar to &cFire Dragon Nests&r with Piles of Copper and the &5Crackled Stone&r looking a lot like &cCharred Stone&r! \\n\\nLevel 1-3 &5Lightning Dragons&r will spawn in &5Roosts&r above the ground (but below Trees) while Levels 4-5 spawn in &5Caves&r underground. Also &5Lightning Dragons&r are Nocturnal, they will Sleep during Day and be awake during Night unlike the other Dragons. \\n\\nWhen you ambush them, they will furiously attack you. Like the other Dragons they'll follow you at Mach 5 to make sure you are dead. Just this one can zap you with &5Lightning&r! \\n\\nIf you can kill them, use an Empty Hand to Right Click their &5Scales&f, &5Flesh&f, and &5Hearts&r off of them! Or use an Empty Bottle to get &5Lightning Dragon Blood&r, but nothing else."]
	quest.06480C731E286A40.title: "Slay a &5Lightning Dragon"
	quest.0F6547179BB45030.quest_desc: ["The &bIce Dragon&r is considered the weakest of the Dragons, but its Environment and &bIcy Breath&r definitely prove that wrong! \\n\\n&bIce Dragons&r will spawn in any Snowy or Cold Biome. You might struggle to find their &bRoosts&r above ground and definitely their &bCaves&r underground. Both are made of Snow, Ice, and Silver Piles. \\n\\nLevels 1-3 will spawn in the &bRoosts&r while Levels 4-5 will spawn in &bCaves&r! \\n\\nWhen you start fighting them they will Slice you with their Claws, Bite down on you, and even &bFreeze&r you with their &bIce Breath&r... definitely try to avoid that one! \\n\\nOnce killed, you can Right Click their Corpse to get their &bScales&f, &bFlesh&f, and &bHeart&r! Or if you do it with a Bottle you can get &bIce Dragon Blood&r."]
	quest.0F6547179BB45030.title: "Slay an &bIce Dragon"
	quest.144BF1BF2E1CDDFA.quest_desc: ["In order to get &9Runes&r we'll need to Carve them. In order to Carve them we'll need a &9Runecarving Table&r. \\n\\nThe Items needed to Craft the &9Table&f is a &bDiamond Sword&f, &7Stone Slab&f, and a &6Wood Table&r. &6Wood Tables&r are made from a couple &6Planks &fand &6Wood Slabs&r! \\n\\nYou'll also need to learn &aBasic Runeworking&r and have 5 Mana in &2&lEarth&r, &9&lSea&r, &b&lSky&r, &e&lSun&r, and &7&lMoon&r. \\n\\nOnce it is Crafted, place it down and use it just like a Stone Cutter!"]
	quest.144BF1BF2E1CDDFA.title: "&9Runecarving"
	quest.1704A63FE432D406.quest_desc: ["&cFire Dragons&r are the most common we see through all media, the stereotype of Dragons is one using its &cFiery Breath&r, to burn down whole Villages! \\n\\nSo of course, we'll need to kill a few of them! \\n\\n&cFire Dragons&r spawn in Warm Biomes besides a few where &5Lightning Dragons&r spawn. They can have Level 1-3 spawn in &cRoosts&r above the surface, or having Level 4-5 spawn in &cCaves&r well below the surface. \\n\\nYou can tell it is a &cFire Dragon's Nest&f by the &cCharred Blocks&r and Copper Piles! \\n\\nThey'll give quite a fight! Blasting you with their &cFire Breath&r, Flying and Grabbing you, Smacking and Biting you. They'll do anything to kill you so prepare to defend yourself! \\n\\nOnce you kill it, its Corpse will drop to the ground, where you can Right Click it with an Empty Hand to get &cScales&f, &cFlesh&f, and &cHearts&r. Or Right Click with an Empty Bottle to only get &cFire Dragon Blood&r!"]
	quest.1704A63FE432D406.title: "Slay a &cFire Dragon"
	quest.198212E7A1990810.quest_desc: ["&9&lDeeper and Darker&r is an Adventure Mod based around a new Dimension, called the &3&lOtherside&r. \\n\\nBefore we worry about exploring it, we'll need to worry about getting there. And that isn't easy. \\n\\nYou'll need to kill the &9&lWarden&r! \\n\\nThis will give us the Items needed to Craft the &9Heart of the Deep&r which, when used on a frame of &8Reinforced Deepslate&r, can make our Portal. \\n\\nBTW it has a Quest Page now!"]
	quest.198212E7A1990810.title: "&9&lDeeper and Darker"
	quest.19E56C4B5A3F9C91.quest_desc: ["To Craft one you'll need an &8Elytra&r, 4 &3Sculk Bones&r which drop from &3Shattered&r, 2 &3Soul Dust&r which drop from &3Sculk Snappers &for &3Sculk Leeches&r, and a &3Soul Crystal&r which drops from the &3&lStalker&r. \\n\\n&3Shattered&r spawn all over the &3&lOtherside&r while the &3&lStalker&r will need a certain way of spawning him. \\n\\nThat being, breaking Ancient Vases until he spawns!"]
	quest.19E56C4B5A3F9C91.title: "&3Soul Elytra"
	quest.2224C9A047244CA4.quest_desc: ["To get our special &9Runes&r we'll need to learn the &aRunes&r in the &8Grimoire&r and our &9Runecarving Table&r to make them. \\n\\nIf you're actually following the Quests you should already have the &9Runecarving Table&r, so research those &aRunes&r as well! \\n\\nNow that we are researched, we can give our &9Table&f a &9Lapis Lazuli&f and a &7Stone Slab&r to make a &9Rune&r. \\n\\nWe'll need to choose which &9Rune&r you want in a similar way to the &7Stone Cutter&r, just click the one you want and it'll be made! \\n\\nClick the &9Summon Rune&f and &9Creature Rune&r."]
	quest.2224C9A047244CA4.title: "&9Summon &fand &9Creature Rune"
	quest.232EF373AA3320F6.quest_desc: ["Welcome to the &6&lBumblezone&r! Everything is either Honey or Bee based! \\n\\nThe Quest Page should help you venture through the &eHive&r. \\n\\nOh wait you haven't gotten into the &eHive&r yet? Well to do that you'll need to either throw an &3Enderpearl&r into a &eHive&r or have a Piston push you into it."]
	quest.232EF373AA3320F6.title: "&6&lBumblezone"
	quest.260281FFD1E012DD.quest_desc: ["We got a whole shopping list of Blocks for this one! I'll go over ways of obtaining them here. \\n\\nFirst, you should already have the &bIesnium Sacrifical Bowl&r and we'll need a Ravager Sacrifice. \\n\\n&bBlock of Iesnium&r, &cBlock of Netherite&r, Endstone Bricks, &bSoul Lanterns&r, and &5Respawn Anchors&r are all Crafted. \\n\\n&8Heavy Core&r, &eSponge&r, &6Bells&r, &dChorus Plants&r, and &3Sculk Catalyst&r can be found by exploring. &3Sculk Catalysts&r will need Silk Touch to grab! \\n\\nLast are &5Budding Amethyst&r and &8Reinforced Deepslate&r. These will need Rituals to Craft as Blocks to be placed."]
	quest.260281FFD1E012DD.title: "&8Eldritch Chalice"
	quest.29CB5FE47CC34552.quest_desc: ["The Ancient Codex is a Spellbook added by &e&lIron's Spells and Spellbooks&r. \\n\\nWe aren't too worried about its use, only its Crafting! \\n\\n&bArcane Cloths&r and &cNetherite&r can be Crafted, everything else isn't that easy... \\n\\nRuined Books are found within &6Ancient Cities&r. &5Bottle O' Lightning&r is kinda simple, just use an Empty Bottle on a Charged Creeper! &4Blood Vials&r are obtained by burning Mobs in either an Alchemist Cauldron or a normal Cauldron above a Campfire."]
	quest.315305F278A8377D.quest_desc: ["For our 1 &5Rune&r we'll need 4? That doesn't sound like a fair exchange but okay! \\n\\nWe'll need a few more of those &3Crystals&r to make our &bIce Rune&f, &dCoral Reef Rune&f, and 2 &5Thunder Runes&r. \\n\\nThe &bCrystal of Winterstorm&r can be made with 8 &bIce&f to get our &bIce Rune&r. \\n\\nThe &dCoral Reef Rune&r will need the &9Crystal of Ocean&r along with the 5 different Coral Blocks: &dBrain&f, &5Bubble&f, &4Fire&f, &eHorn&f, and &9Tube&r. \\n\\nLast is our 2 for 1 on &5Thunder Runes&r. Each cost 1 &5Crystal of Thunder&r and 8 &5Struck Logs&r."]
	quest.315305F278A8377D.title: "Runes!"
	quest.33FB9C2A7A179BBC.quest_desc: [
		"In order to do fancy &6Rituals&r in &lPrimal Magick&r we'll need a few Blocks! \\n\\nCrafting these Items aren't at all difficult so I won't focus on those. Instead I'll focus on how to actually use them. \\n\\nPlace the &6Ritual Altar&r in the middle, this won't have any Items on it but it will connect to every other Block as well as having the Product spawn on it. \\n\\nNext, is our Offering Pedestals. These will be where we place our Offerings. The Pedestals can be placed next to the &6Altar&r but in order to connect Props we'll need at least a Block of space to place our Salt. \\n\\nAfter, the Pedestals is Props. Some &6Rituals&r require Props which can be placed nearby the &6Altar&r and will needed to be connected via... \\n\\n&7Refined Salt&r! In order to connect the Pedestals and Props to the &6Altar&r we'll need to place &7Refined Salt&r on the Ground to connect them. The &7Refined Salt&r is placed like &4Redstone&r, and will light up when a connection to the &6Altar&r is made."
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_primal.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.33FB9C2A7A179BBC.title: "&6Rituals"
	quest.3428DF3F6F18D4B1.quest_desc: ["&eArchmage Spellbook&r is the third Tier of &eSpellbook &d&lArs&r gives! \\n\\nYou'll need 3 &3Enderpearls&r, 2 &aEmeralds&r, a &6Totem of Undying&r, a &bNether Star&r, and a &5Wilden Tribute&r. \\n\\nThat means you'll have to kill an Evoker, a &0&lWither&r, and the &5&lWilden Chimera&r! Good luck with that! \\n\\nYou'll also need the previous Tier of &eSpellbook&r, the &eMage's Spellbook&r."]
	quest.3428DF3F6F18D4B1.title: "&eArchmage Spellbook"
	quest.36A56A4DD278181B.quest_desc: ["You can get this in the same way of the &5Unobtainium Mage Hat&r. \\n\\nUpgrade your Ancient Codex to an &6Allthemodium Spell Book&r, then to &3Vibrainium&r, and finally &5Unobtainium&r!"]
	quest.36A56A4DD278181B.title: "&5Unobtainium Spell Book"
	quest.378698BCA1B42EC8.quest_desc: [
		"This Quest has been authored by &6AllTheMods Staff&r, or a &2Community contributor&r for use in AllTheMods Modpacks. "
		""
		"As all &6AllTheMods&r packs are licensed under &eAll Rights Reserved&r, this Quest is not allowed to be used in any public packs not released by &6AllTheMods Team&r without explicit permission. "
		""
		"This quest is intentionally hidden, if you're seeing this, you're in editing mode."
	]
	quest.3CB76ABD14AAF4EB.quest_desc: ["You'll need 14 &bNether Star Block 1xs&r. \\n\\nIf each &bCompressed Nether Star Block&r is 9 &bNether Star Blocks&r, then you'll need 126 &bNether Star Blocks&r. \\n\\nAnd if every &bNether Star Block&r is 9 &dNether Stars&r, then you'll need... 1,134 &dNether Stars&r..."]
	quest.3CB76ABD14AAF4EB.title: "14 &bCompressed 1x Nether Star Blocks&r"
	quest.3E7943617E1636D7.quest_desc: ["Rock Salt comes from Mining or Smelting Rock Salt Ore. \\n\\nRock Salt Ore spawns in any Biome Underground. \\n\\nThat's pretty much it!"]
	quest.4000239DCA5A8094.quest_desc: ["The &5Crystal of Thunder&r will be needed to make &5Thunder Runes&r and our &5Thunderstorm Rune&r. \\n\\nWe should already have our &6Rituals&r ready, same with getting our &5Struck Logs&f and &3Crystal of Nature&f and &2Earth&r. \\nWe just need to worry about the other &3Crystals&r: &9Ocean&f, &bWinterstorm&f, and &cFlame&r! \\n\\nThe &9Crystal of Ocean&r is made from 8 &3Prismarine Blocks&r and a &3Conduit&r in a &6Ritual&r. \\n\\n&bCrystal of Winterstorm&r is made from a &3Crystal of Nature&r surrounded by 4 &bIce Blocks&f, 2 &bPacked Ice&f, and 2 &bBlue Ice&r. But... we need it powered! So collect Powder Snow with that &bCrystal&r to fill it! \\n\\n&cCrystal of Flame&r is made with 8 &cMagma Blocks&f and a &3Crystal of Nature&r. It will also need to fed, just this time with &cLava&r."]
	quest.4000239DCA5A8094.title: "&5Crystal of Thunder"
	quest.40E2137932E62FEB.quest_desc: ["&4Pure Blood&r is a drop from &4&lVampire Barons&r. Its &2Level&r is determined by the &4&lBaron's&r &2Level&r. \\n\\n&4&lVampire Barons&r are boss &4Vampires&r which spawn in &8Vampire Forests&r. \\n\\nThey are Hostile to all Players and other &4&lBarons&r. And yes they are difficult to kill! \\n\\nOf course &2Level 5&r being the hardest to kill... which are the ones we need to kill for the &6&lATM Star&r."]
	quest.40E2137932E62FEB.title: "&4Level 5 Pure Blood"
	quest.436867D6E3637E1E.quest_desc: ["&dPatrick &aStar&r is only the most important part of the &6&lATM Star&r! He gives it, its shape! It wouldn't be the &6&lATM Star&r without &dPatrick &aStar&r. \\n\\nTo Craft him, we'll need the &6Mechanical Crafters&r mentioned in the previous Quest. We'll put all the Concretes into the &6Crafters&r and yes unfortunately the pattern matters... \\n\\nTo Craft him you'll need exactly: 11 &dPink Concrete&r, 5 &dPink Concrete Powder&r, 13 &5Magenta Concrete&r, 8 &5Magenta Concrete Powder&r, 8 &2Green Concrete&r, 8 &2Green Concrete Powder&r, and 2 &aLime Concrete&r."]
	quest.436867D6E3637E1E.title: "&dPatrick &aStar"
	quest.48A3A67D9CF90D0B.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lCreate&r contains machines called the &6Mechanical Crafters&r. We'll need these for Crafting the &dPatrick &aStar&r and &6&lATM Star&r. \\n\\nTo use them, we'll first need to place them down and supply them with Rotational Force. Then, we can set where the Items will go. \\n\\nIn order for it to Craft, all the &6Crafters&r need the Arrows to send Items together into one last Block which will Craft it. To change the Arrows directions, use the &6&lCreate&r &6Wrench&r. \\n\\nThis includes special Crafting Recipes. Some Recipes will need more than just a 3x3 of &6Mechanical Crafters&r! For these we will need the specific design shown in Picture below. It is a 9x9 Star shape. \\n\\nOnce we have all of them set, and they have Rotational Force, we can add our Items. Either through simply Right Clicking the Items onto the &6Crafters&r, or Inputting them into the Blocks."
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap2/chap3_create.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.48A3A67D9CF90D0B.title: "Crafting with &6&lCreate"
	quest.4A492FE61EB7CAE8.quest_desc: [
		"We'll need to kill quite a few &cFire Dragons&r to get our &cFire Dragon Forge&r. \\nFirst, we'll need &7Dragon Bones&f from &7Dragon Skeletons&f to make our 8 &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r. \\n\\nThen, we'll need a ton of &cScales&f and a &cDragon Heart&r to make the other Blocks. The Scale color doesn't matter, as long as it is from a &cFire Dragon&r! \\n\\nThe &cDragon Forge&r is a 3x3x3 Structure that will be ready for use immediately after Building it. To build it, follow these Steps!"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_fire1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 1: place a Cross of 5 &cFire Dragon Forge Bricks&r. Then, place &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r in each of the corners to make a 3x1x3. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_fire2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 2: put the &cFire Dragon Forge Core&r in the dead center and place the &cFire Dragon Forge Aperature&r next to it on the side you want the front to be. Then, you can fill in the rest of that layer with &cFire Dragon Forge Bricks&r. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_fire3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 3: repeat the first Step just on top of the second layer!"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_fire4.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4A492FE61EB7CAE8.title: "&cFire Dragon Forge"
	quest.4B2352B055D51D7C.quest_desc: ["Wanna combine the strongest Material in Modded &2&lMinecraft&r with the... third? Then, you'll need some &bIcey Dragons &fand &bDragon Forges&r! \\n\\nBefore we do all of that though, let's prepare our Molten Metals. \\n\\nTake some &6AllTheModium&f and &5Unobtainium&r Ingots and &9Soul Lava&r which spawns in Structures in &b&lThe Other&r. Then, use the Ingots in the &c&lFoundry&r with the &9Soul Lava&r as a Fuel Source to Melt them! \\n\\nOnce Melted, pour them into Buckets. Then, our Buckets of Molten Metals can be placed within the &bIce Dragon Forge&r. \\n\\nWith an &bIce Dragon&r (friendly or not) nearby, they will automatically power the &bForge&r!"]
	quest.4B2352B055D51D7C.quest_subtitle: "Freeze AllTheModium and Unobtainium to each other"
	quest.4B2352B055D51D7C.title: "&5Unobtainium&f-&6AllTheModium&f Alloy Block"
	quest.4B4335D3D140C88B.quest_desc: ["Okay let's go over this. \\n\\n&5&nCrystal of Thunder&r: &a&oCheck&r. \\n\\n&n4 Runes&r: &a&oCheck&r. \\n\\n&3Poseidite&r? What the &5Struck&r is that? \\n\\nWe can get &3Poseidite&r by Smelting a &3Trident&r in a Furnace. That seems like a very cruel Recipe, thankfully &5&lApotheosis&r makes it easier to Craft!"]
	quest.4B4335D3D140C88B.title: "&5Rune: Thunderstorm"
	quest.4E1957EEC79218DC.quest_desc: [
		"Now... it is ready! \\n\\nCraft all the Items needed. \\n\\nThen, place Mechanical Crafters in the arrangement shown in the Picture and give them &dRotational Power&r. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap2/chap3_create.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Once you place all the Items in the Mechanical Crafters (in the right order) it will create the &6&lATM Star&r! \\n\\nBut what's next..."
	]
	quest.4E1957EEC79218DC.title: "&6&lATM Star"
	quest.5177A629813BDF0D.quest_desc: ["Before we start Alloying everything, we'll need our Molten Metals! \\n\\nGrab a ton of &6AllTheModium&f and &3Vibranium&r as well as some &9Soul Lava&r from &b&lThe Other&r. Melt the &6AllTheModium&r with our &9Soul Lava&r in the &c&lFoundry&r and then pour it into a Bucket. Repeat this with our &3Vibranium&r to have our Molten Metals ready! \\n\\nNow, place our Buckets of our &3Molten Vibranium&f and &6AllTheModium&r into the &cFire Dragon Forge&r. \\n\\nOnce they are in, our &cFire Dragon&r at hand should Power it up! It can be either a Tamed &cFire Dragon&f or a &cWild Fire Dragon&r that is Chained up nearby with Sticky Chains, either work!"]
	quest.5177A629813BDF0D.quest_subtitle: "Melt together AllTheModium and Vibranium"
	quest.5177A629813BDF0D.title: "&3Vibranium&f-&6AllTheModium&f Alloy Block"
	quest.520B26EE983CDC6D.quest_desc: [
		"Get ready for a ton of furious fighting, we'll need quite a few &5Lightning Dragons&r killed for our &5Lightning Dragon Forge&r! \\n\\nFirst, we'll need &7Dragon Bones&f from &7Dragon Skeletons&f to make our 8 &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r. \\n\\nThen, we'll need a ton of &5Scales &fand a &5Dragon Heart&r to make the other Blocks. The &5Scale&r color doesn't matter, as long as it is &5Lightning Dragon Scales&r! \\n\\nThe &5Dragon Forge&r is a 3x3x3 Structure that will be ready for use immediately after Building it. To build it, follow these Steps! "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_light1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 1: place a Cross of 5 &5Lightning Dragon Forge Bricks&r. Then, place &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r in each of the corners to make a 3x1x3."
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_light2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 2: put the &5Lightning Dragon Forge Core&r in the dead center and place the &5Lightning Dragon Forge Aperature&r next to it on the side you want the front to be. Then, you can fill in the rest of that layer with &5Lightning Dragon Forge Bricks&r. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_light3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 3: repeat the first Step just on top of the second layer!"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_light4.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.520B26EE983CDC6D.title: "&5Lightning Dragon Forge"
	quest.545A5E98F829C2AC.quest_desc: ["&4&lVampirism&r a Mod that is new to &6&lAllTheMods&r! \\n\\nIt is all about the war between &4Vampires&r and &bVampire Hunters&r! Best part is, we get to join in! \\n\\nCheck out the Quest Page to learn more on how to join and what to do."]
	quest.545A5E98F829C2AC.title: "&4&lVampirism"
	quest.54DF40142076AD03.quest_desc: [
		"Hope you don't mind the Cold, we'll need a lot of dead &bIce Dragons&r for the &bIce Dragon Forge&r! \\n\\nFirst, we'll need &7Dragon Bones&f from &7Dragon Skeletons&f to make our 8 &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r. \\n\\nThen, we'll need a ton of &bScales &fand a &bDragon Heart&r to make the other Blocks. The &bScale&r color doesn't matter, they're all pretty similar anyways! \\n\\nThe &bDragon Forge&r is a 3x3x3 Structure that will be ready for use immediately after Building it. To build it, follow these Steps! "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_ice1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 1: place a Cross of 5 &bIce Dragon Forge Bricks&r. Then, place &7Dragon Bone Blocks&r in each of the corners to make a 3x1x3. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_ice2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 2: put the &bIce Dragon Forge Core&r in the dead center and place the &bIce Dragon Forge Aperature&r next to it on the side you want the front to be. Then, you can fill in the rest of that layer with &bIce Dragon Forge Bricks&r. "
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_ice3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"Step 3: repeat the first Step just on top of the second layer!"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_ice4.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.54DF40142076AD03.title: "&bIce Dragon Forge"
	quest.5A373ECCAAFC6675.quest_desc: ["&bMana Salts&r will be needed for our little &eHallowed Pixies&r. \\n\\nTo Craft it we'll need &4Redstone Dust&r and &lPrimal&r &bDust&r. These are both Mined to get. \\n\\nNext, we'll need &7Refined Salt&r. Smelt Rock Salt to get &7Refined Salt&r. This means we can Smelt Rock Salt Ore twice to get &7Refined Salt&r. \\n\\nWait we can't just Craft it yet? We'll need to learn &aManaweaving&r from our &8Grimoire&r. \\n\\nWe won't be set with just learning of course though we'll also need 5 &2&lEarth&r, &9&lSea&r, &a&lSky&r, &e&lSun&r, and &7&lMoon&r Mana!"]
	quest.5A373ECCAAFC6675.title: "&bMana Salts"
	quest.5AA1EA3598E69D82.quest_desc: [
		"Don't worry, these Recipes aren't too scary. We will just need to &5zap&r an &5Amethyst Block&f and a &9Lapis Lazuli&r to get some Crystals! The rest of the Items are &2&lVanilla&r. \\n\\nWe'll need 1 &6Ritual Matrix&r which acts as the center Block, along with 8 &6Ritual Altars&r. \\n\\nThen, place the &6Ritual Matrix&r in the center with each of the &6Ritual Altars&r a 1 Block gap away. Like in this picture!"
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/chap3/chap3_glimmer.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"After that, follow the Recipes in EMI and place the Items accordingly. The center Item will go in the &6Ritual Matrix&r and the rest will be on the &6Altars&r. \\n\\nOnce all Items are in, use a &3Wand&r on the &6Matrix&r to start it."
	]
	quest.5AA1EA3598E69D82.title: "&6Rituals"
	quest.5C4D6253655A4A6F.quest_desc: ["&eHallowed Items&r aren't found in &2&lWorld&r, they're actually Crafted for! \\n\\nIt starts off with &eDust&r that we get from using &eHumming Artifacts&r in a &7Calcinator&r. \\nTo make a &7Calcinator&r Craft an &7Essence Furnace&r (made by using a &6Wand&f on a &7Furnace&r) with 5 Marble Blocks and 3 Dust. \\n\\nDon't know where &eHumming Artifacts&r come from? They are Chest Loot from Structures all around our &2&lWorlds&r!"]
	quest.5C4D6253655A4A6F.title: "&7Calcinating&r?"
	quest.5C5E1C36B9F8A91B.quest_desc: ["&l&bIce &fand &cFire&r is all about Mythical Creatures, most importantly Dragons! \\n\\nThese fearsome beasts spawn all over the &2&lOverworld&r (thankfully away from Spawn). They guard their Roosts above ground and their Caves below it! \\n\\nThey have different Levels with the higher it is, the stronger they are. But hey that also means more Loot. "]
	quest.5C5E1C36B9F8A91B.title: "&l&bIce &fand &cFire"
	quest.5D91262B9FF0D862.quest_desc: ["&e&lIron&r has blessed us with a Mod with as much &dMagic&r as the Mod title is long! \\n\\nThe Mod is all about exploring and Crafting new Spells. \\n\\nIt has a Quest Page and yes you'll need &bArcane Cloths&r to start making the &6&lStar&r!"]
	quest.5D91262B9FF0D862.title: "&e&lIron's Spells and Spellbooks"
	quest.5E2FFDB60A999377.quest_desc: ["Now that we got a Classy Hat, we'll need to Upgrade it! \\n\\nCombine it with an &6Allthemodium Ingot&r and &6Smithing Template&r to create the &6Allthemodium Mage Hat&r. \\n\\nAfter that, we can use the new Hat with a &3Vibrainium Ingot&r and &3Smithing Template&r to make a &3Vibrainium Mage Hat&r. \\n\\nRinse and repeat, now use the &3Vibrainium Hat&r with an &5Unobtainium Ingot&r and &5Smithing Template&r to get the Hat we need!"]
	quest.5E2FFDB60A999377.title: "&5Unobtainium Mage Hat"
	quest.60E0CB8215F8EDAE.quest_desc: ["The &5Unobtainium &eSpellbook&r is the most powerful &eSpellbook &d&lArs&r can give. \\n\\nIt can cast any Glyphs you got! I don't know of any other limits it passes, I don't use &d&lArs&r much. \\n\\nTo make it we'll need to upgrade the &eArchmage Spellbook&r, to &6Allthemodium &eSpellbook&r. Then, repeat that enough until you get &5Unobtainium &eSpellbook&r."]
	quest.60E0CB8215F8EDAE.title: "&5Unobtainium &eSpellbook"
	quest.63520659D39A0F1E.quest_desc: ["We missed &lTinkers&r so much that &aLobsterJonn&r made his own! &c&lProductive Metalworks&r! \\n\\nThis gorgeous Mod adds the new Multiblock named &c&lThe Foundry&r. We will be needing to use it to make our Alloys! \\nFirst, you'll need to Craft each of these Blocks as well as either &cFire Bricks&f or &cFoundry Glass&r. \\n\\nThe &6Liquid Heating Coils&r will be the Floor of the &c&lFoundry&r and will heat it up. \\n\\nThe &aController&f, &bDrain&f, and &4Tank&r will make up parts of the Walls. The &aController&r is used to view Liquid Levels and add Items. &bDrain&r will interact with Taps and Buckets to take out Liquids. &4Tanks&r will give us a place to put our Fuel for the &c&lFoundry&r. \\n\\nThen, the rest of the walls will be made of either &cFire Bricks&r or &cFoundry Glass&r. The corners of the &c&lFoundry&r won't matter and neither does the size!"]
	quest.63520659D39A0F1E.title: "&c&lThe Foundry"
	quest.68937957647A1079.quest_desc: ["&6Wands&r are very important for Interacting with the World and with Blocks! \\n\\nThe most basic &6Wand &fis the &6Mundane Wand&r, just Craft it with a Stick and a &bDust&r! \\n\\nYou don't know how to get the &bDust&r? Just visit any &lPrimal Magick&r Shrine, and Mine below the &9Water&r. Here you'll find Ore that will Drop these &bDusts&r. \\n\\nNow that we have our &6Wand&r, we can Hold Right Click while viewing certain Blocks to change them into new ones. \\n\\nUse it on a &6Crafting Table&r to make an &3Arcane Workbench&r. Try it on a &7Furnace&r to make an &7Essence Furnace&r."]
	quest.68937957647A1079.title: "&6Wands &rand Machines"
	quest.6C905CC5F4341985.quest_desc: ["&d&lArs Nouveau&r is one of the most popular &dMagic Mods&r out there! \\n\\nIt is a very important mod here in &d&lAll the Magic - Arcana&r, especially its &dSource&r. \\n\\nIt has a Quest Page you can check out to learn more!"]
	quest.6C905CC5F4341985.title: "&d&lArs Nouveau"
	quest.6E5522A423C74902.quest_desc: ["I hope you got a &8Grimoire&r, because we'll definitely need one! \\n\\nThis little special &8Book&r will act as your Ingame Guide and Textbook for all things &lPrimal Magick&r! \\n\\nYou'll need to read through many of the Chapters in order to gain Knowledge to continue on in the Mod. You'll also need to find and discover Items and Structures to advance as well. \\n\\nSounds like it works both ways and that you'll definitely need to keep this &8Book&r on you!"]
	quest.6E5522A423C74902.title: "&lPrimal Magick"
	quest.702520F18627BE24.quest_desc: ["Yes, &6&lBumblezone&r has a progression to follow! \\n\\nYou'll need to explore the different Structures to get to the Throne Room, here you can find the &5Queen Bee&r. \\n\\nTo get the Essence of Bees you'll need to complete 16 Achievements before getting it! \\n\\nI am not going to list them all off but you can find them in &6&lBumblezone's&r Quest Page or even just Achievements by pressing L."]
	quest.71C0768E8276EA6E.quest_desc: ["Sorry to jump a bit far into &b&lOccultism&r with this Quest, but trust me we need a lot of Quest space for these! \\n\\nBefore we worry about the &8Eldritch Chalice&r we'll need the &bIesnium Sacrificial Bowl&r. \\n\\nThe Book of Binding Bound to an Afrit, &bIesnium Block&r, &5Spirit Attuned Crystal&r, and &eGolden Sacrifical Bowls&r are all Crafting Recipes. \\n\\nThe other two need Rituals, one with a Book bound to Afrit and the other a Book bound to Foliot. \\n\\nAfrit Essence needs the Book Afrit with &4Netherrack&r, &7Gunpowder&r, Quartz, and Flint and Steel. It will also need a Cow for Sacrifice. This Ritual will summon an Afrit Entity which can be killed for its &cEssence&r. \\n\\n&aResearch Fragment Dust&r needs the Book Foliot, &aEmerald Dust&r, and 2 &aBottle O' Enchanting&r."]
	quest.71C0768E8276EA6E.title: "&bIesnium Sacrificial Bowl"
	quest.71C9A4B28726A997.quest_desc: ["Although not the only way to farm &dNether Stars&r, &aMystical Agriculture&r offers a fairly easy method to produce a large amount of them.\\n\\nAll you need are &bNether Star Seeds&r planted on Farmland with a &bNether Star Crux&r placed underneath the Farmland.\\n\\nYou can set up some pretty insane &aFarms&r to make the process very fast!"]
	quest.71C9A4B28726A997.title: "&dNether Star&r Farming"
	quest.735164D456F485D9.quest_desc: ["In order to make &6&lAllTheWizard&r Gear, we'll need a Hat with Class! \\n\\nWhen I say Class I don't mean: Top Hats, saying Please, and not burping, I mean an &e&lIron's&r Class! \\n\\n&2Nature&r, &cFire&r, &dEnder&r any... it doesn't matter which just make one. \\n\\nAll are made in a similar way, 5 &bArcane Cloths&r and a Classed Rune."]
	quest.735164D456F485D9.title: "Classy Hats"
	quest.76F69C44F0F00414.quest_desc: ["Of course to combine the strongest Materials we'll need to kill the strongest &5Dragons&r! Actually quite a few of them, I highly doubt you can make AND Power a &5Lightning Forge&r with 1 &5Dragon&r! \\n\\nHopefully you're following the Quests by now we should have the &5Dragons&r dealt with, now we need to worry about our Molten Metals. \\n\\nTake some &3Vibranium&f and &5Unobtainium&r, along with some &9Soul Lava&r from &b&lThe Other&r and use them in a &c&lFoundry&r to Melt the Metals! \\n\\nAfter that, pour the Metals into a Bucket and place that very hot Bucket into a &5Lightning Dragon Forge&r. \\n\\nIf there is a friendly or unfriendly &5Lightning Dragon&f near the &5Lightning Forge&r, they will Power it and we will get our Alloy Block!"]
	quest.76F69C44F0F00414.quest_subtitle: "Zap Vibranium and Unobtainium to stick to one another"
	quest.76F69C44F0F00414.title: "&5Unobtainium&f-&3Vibranium&f Alloy Block"
	quest.78A91C417387474B.quest_desc: ["Welcome to &5&lGlimmering Tales&r! A wonderful Magic Mod designed a whole lot around &5Lightning&r! \\n\\nYou'll need to find Struck Logs, which can spawn in the &2&lOverworld&r in Struck Trees. \\n\\nYou can also make Struck Logs by having Logs get struck by &5Lightning&r. \\n\\nWhen you set a Struck Log on Fire, &5Lightning&r will strike it. This will be helpful for many many many recipes here. \\n\\nHeck you can even use other Mods to help you get &5Lightning&r! This Mod isn't picky!"]
	quest.78A91C417387474B.title: "&5&lGlimmering Tales"
	quest.7D73CE6654EDEC25.quest_desc: ["Now that we have our &2Elemental Hats&r we can throw them in a Smithing Table with our &5Ingots&f and &5Upgrades&r to get up the &5Unobtainium &dArcanist Hat&r!"]
	quest.7D73CE6654EDEC25.title: "&5Unobtanium &dArcanist Hat"
	quest.7D81E6542A9E033F.quest_desc: ["With Smelting the &eHumming Artifacts&r we can finally get &eHallowed Dust&r. \\n\\nWe can then use Quartz to get some Quartz Sliver. Combine a Quartz Sliver with 8 &eDust&f to get 1 &eHallowed Shard&r. \\n\\nWe can keep combining them with a bunch of other crap to get even better &eHallowed Items&r... but we only care about the &eHallowed Pixie&r. \\n\\nWhich only needs a &eHallowed Shard&r!"]
	quest.7D81E6542A9E033F.title: "&eHallowed Shard"
	task.07C1576746BF4140.title: "AllRightsReserved"
	task.192BB74D84D804BB.title: "Hats"
	task.2F36A18A7B170B25.title: "Calcinators"
	task.4C722E42E2394713.title: "Hats"
}
